  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 21-layer HfO2/SiO2 defect-cavity stack on fused silica substrate with air incident medium. Layer sequence: HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2(defect)|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2. Initialize thicknesses to Round 3 optimal vector [250.6, 306.5, 256.0, 300.9, 269.6, 278.7, 239.9, 252.1, 238.387, 334.157, 200.0, 272.928, 192.949, 242.657, 338.575, 246.850, 246.143, 284.074, 228.257, 247.132, 167.188] nm. Apply gradient_thickness optimizer with mutation amplitude bounded to ±2.5% of seed values. Evaluate at normal incidence across 400-700 nm (reflectance target) and 1530-1565 nm (transmittance target) wavelength bands. Score candidates by dual-band objective function weighting both bands equally. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
